{"4809540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Clean Those Carpets! - Carpet Cleaning Simulator", "steam_appid": 4809540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4954000, 4954010], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dirt comes off layer by layer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809540/extras/d57cfdd8b6ec05f7ca55d9f9dd567f33.poster.avif?t=1788145843\" width=440 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809540/extras/d57cfdd8b6ec05f7ca55d9f9dd567f33.webm?t=1788145843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809540/extras/d57cfdd8b6ec05f7ca55d9f9dd567f33.mp4?t=1788145843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever seen a video of someone cleaning a really filthy carpet until it's spotless? Now you can do it yourself! Strip away the dirt layer by layer until the carpet shines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plenty of tools</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809540/extras/497819a9dd13f26c6fbfc0832bf4433e.poster.avif?t=1788145843\" width=440 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809540/extras/497819a9dd13f26c6fbfc0832bf4433e.webm?t=1788145843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809540/extras/497819a9dd13f26c6fbfc0832bf4433e.mp4?t=1788145843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleaning is a multi-step ritual. Beat out the dry dust, soak the pile with the hose, work it with the brush, collect the dirty water and dry it off with the vacuum. Every tool works differently and has its own pros and cons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your tools and garage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809540/extras/2cddbc4cd3f3e4a801d2d7a88e1da72d.poster.avif?t=1788145843\" width=440 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809540/extras/2cddbc4cd3f3e4a801d2d7a88e1da72d.webm?t=1788145843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809540/extras/2cddbc4cd3f3e4a801d2d7a88e1da72d.mp4?t=1788145843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tools can be upgraded! Tackle increasingly tricky cleaning jobs faster with ever more upgraded tools!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No two carpets are the same</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809540/extras/d477f5b7e21ad1a2a2c5eaf00afd28f5.poster.avif?t=1788145843\" width=440 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809540/extras/d477f5b7e21ad1a2a2c5eaf00afd28f5.webm?t=1788145843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809540/extras/d477f5b7e21ad1a2a2c5eaf00afd28f5.mp4?t=1788145843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge variety of carpets for every taste and color! Plus special &quot;special carpets&quot; that may feature all kinds of iconic rugs or memes.